2273:- 八个 v15 库有 834 次日初预抽取，其中 576 次之前已有同日新观点；此数是上下文暴露，不是错误数。删除预抽取，让一条写完下一条再抽，恢复 D31/D63 的顺序要求。D155 中这一顺序修复不再等待分组语义试验；分组仍不因此启用。未完成的旧并行交接明确拒绝恢复，保留原数据，不静默重抽。
2301:## D163 · 2026-10-25 · English for the maintained project
2309:## D164 · 2026-10-25 · Claude builds the English library on Codex's plan; the watch list is a reference, not a gate
2311:- Alex stopped the keyed-views line as Claude had built it overnight, on seeing that the per-object watch list decided what may open: "你这个做法难道不是非常的限死吗？永远都是一堆财务指标，真正的观点呢？", "你现在是写死一些一定需要关注的证据吧？", then "停了吧，codex 再重整呢". The code-owned key (identity: is this the same quantity?) stays; what is worth a thesis is the analyst-model's judgement (00-system: 候选观点是抽取交出去的、已有观点管不到的要紧事). Codex had already recorded the same correction as D155.
2312:- Alex then handed the English library build (D163, [english-library.md](research/2026-10-25-english/english-library.md)) to Claude: "好那你按照codex 需求来重建，然后开始充分的测试，一定要仔细的看结果以及评量". The build log with one row per measured step, costs and mistakes is [build-log.md](research/2026-10-25-english/build-log.md).
2314:- The seed build runs on the 20 NVIDIA documents of 2026-02-25..07-23 with a $5 cap, then the week 2026-07-24..31 and August 1–15 on the same ledger, each stage read before the next; the API and UI are pointed at the English ledger only after that. Grouping stays out of the default pipeline (D149, D162 unchanged).
2316:## D165 · 2026-10-25 · Research groups enter the default pipeline; a group is an ongoing matter, a company's own financial lines carry none
2318:- Alex, on learning that the grouping research (D142–D150, D156–D162) had not reached the pipeline: "把我要做的grouping逻辑充分地scope in 做第一周管线的验证". Claude put the D149 contract in D147's final form into the default pipeline (`thesis_groups`, `thesis_group_members`, extraction v7 with `group_refs` and `new_groups`, the writer resolving local ids and storing memberships with the theses, matching deciding none), config `poc-v19`.
2319:- The first grouped seed day showed the company-folder failure (eight NVDA financial theses in one "AI infrastructure demand" group) because every candidate had to cite a group. Alex chose the correction from the two offered ("看起来可以你深度思考计划之后改再跑"): a research group is one ongoing matter in the world that several questions track together (a product rollout and its deployments, a financing or acquisition deal, a policy process, an investment or demand cycle), usually across companies and themes; a company's own reported or guided financial lines (total or segment revenue, margins, expenses, tax rate, capex) belong to the company and carry no group unless the line itself tracks such a matter. Code guards it: a declared group is created only when a written thesis that tracks a matter cites it; the lines may join a group another thesis founded. This amends D149's "every proposed thesis carries structured membership" and 06-views' "every candidate needs nonempty references". Config `poc-v20` (`role-v8`).
