EV e75 NVIDIA CFO Colette Kress 在 2026 年 5 月 20 日财报电话会上表示，公司预计当年 CPU 总收入接近 200 亿美元。 QUOTE On the May 20 earnings call, Colette Kress, Executive Vice President and CFO, said Vera “opens a brand new $200 billion TAM for NVIDIA, a market we have never addressed before,” adding: “We have visibility to nearly $20 billion in total CPU revenue this year, setting us up to become the world-leading CPU supplier.”
